+.. change::
+   :tags: bug, mssql
+   :tickets: 4536
+   :versions: 1.3.1
+
+   A commit() is emitted after an isolation level change to SNAPSHOT, as both
+   pyodbc and pymssql open an implicit transaction which blocks subsequent SQL
+   from being emitted in the current transaction.
